{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24440","headline":"慕巢尚书书云室人欲爲置一歌者非所安也以诗相报因而和之 · 白居易","name":"慕巢尚书书云室人欲爲置一歌者非所安也以诗相报因而和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东川已过二三春，南国须求一两人。\n富贵大都多老大，欢娱太半爲亲宾。\n如愁翠黛应堪重，买笑黄金莫诉贫。\n他日相逢一杯酒，尊前还要落梁尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}